# Analyse Complète - Apios Garage SaaS

## 📋 Vue d'Ensemble

Apios Garage est une solution SaaS multi-tenant pour la gestion de garages automobiles. Cette analyse compare l'implémentation actuelle avec les fonctionnalités prévues dans [features.md](file:///c:/Users/dry-_/OneDrive/Bureau/Apios/apios_garage_bolt/planning/features.md).

---

## 🗄️ Schéma de Base de Données Actuel

### Diagramme Entité-Relation

```mermaid
erDiagram
    tenants ||--o{ profiles : "employs"
    tenants ||--o{ clients : "manages"
    tenants ||--o{ vehicles : "tracks"
    tenants ||--o{ interventions : "performs"
    tenants ||--o{ appointments : "schedules"
    tenants ||--o{ services : "offers"
    tenants ||--o{ invoices : "bills"
    tenants ||--o{ tenant_subscriptions : "subscribes"
    
    subscription_plans ||--o{ tenant_subscriptions : "provides"
    
    clients ||--o{ vehicles : "owns"
    clients ||--o{ invoices : "receives"
    
    vehicles ||--o{ interventions : "serviced_in"
    vehicles ||--o{ appointments : "scheduled_for"
    vehicles ||--o{ repair_history : "has_history"
    
    interventions ||--o{ intervention_parts : "uses"
    interventions ||--o{ intervention_photos : "documents"
    interventions ||--o| invoices : "billed_as"
    
    profiles ||--o{ interventions : "assigned_to"
    profiles ||--o{ appointments : "assigned_to"
    
    invoices ||--o{ invoice_items : "contains"
```

### Tables Principales

#### 🏢 Multi-Tenancy Core

**`tenants`** - Garages inscrits sur la plateforme
- `id` (uuid, PK)
- `name` (text) - Nom du garage
- `slug` (text, unique) - Pour URLs publiques (ex: `garage-paris.apios.com`)
- `email`, `phone`, `address` - Coordonnées
- `subscription_status` (text) - active, suspended, cancelled
- `suspended_at`, `suspension_reason` - Gestion des suspensions
- `created_at`, `updated_at`

**`profiles`** - Utilisateurs étendus (auth.users)
- `id` (uuid, PK, FK → auth.users)
- `tenant_id` (uuid, FK → tenants) - NULL pour SUPERADMIN
- `role` (text) - SUPERADMIN, TENANT_ADMIN, RECEPTION, MECHANIC, ACCOUNTANT
- `full_name` (text)
- `phone` (text)
- `created_at`, `updated_at`

**`subscription_plans`** - Plans d'abonnement
- `id` (uuid, PK)
- `name` (text) - Basic, Pro, Business
- `price_monthly` (numeric)
- `max_users`, `max_vehicles`, `max_storage_gb` (integer)
- `features` (jsonb) - Fonctionnalités additionnelles
- `is_active` (boolean)

**`tenant_subscriptions`** - Abonnements des garages
- `id` (uuid, PK)
- `tenant_id` (uuid, FK → tenants)
- `plan_id` (uuid, FK → subscription_plans)
- `status` (text) - active, suspended, cancelled
- `started_at`, `expires_at` (timestamptz)

---

#### 👥 Gestion Clients & Véhicules

**`clients`** - Clients des garages
- `id` (uuid, PK)
- `tenant_id` (uuid, FK → tenants)
- `name` (text)
- `phone`, `email`, `address` (text)
- `created_at`, `updated_at`

**`vehicles`** - Parc automobile
- `id` (uuid, PK)
- `tenant_id` (uuid, FK → tenants)
- `client_id` (uuid, FK → clients)
- `license_plate` (text) - Immatriculation
- `make`, `model` (text) - Marque, modèle
- `year`, `mileage` (integer)
- `vin` (text) - Numéro de série
- `color`, `fuel_type` (text)
- `notes` (text)
- `created_at`, `updated_at`

---

#### 🔧 Gestion Interventions

**`interventions`** - Réparations et entretiens
- `id` (uuid, PK)
- `tenant_id` (uuid, FK → tenants)
- `client_id` (uuid, FK → clients)
- `vehicle_id` (uuid, FK → vehicles)
- `mechanic_id` (uuid, FK → profiles, nullable)
- `description` (text)
- `status` (text) - pending, in_progress, completed
- `estimated_cost`, `actual_cost` (numeric)
- `notes` (text)
- `started_at`, `completed_at` (timestamptz)
- `created_at`, `updated_at`

**`intervention_parts`** - Pièces utilisées
- `id` (uuid, PK)
- `tenant_id` (uuid, FK → tenants)
- `intervention_id` (uuid, FK → interventions)
- `name` (text)
- `quantity`, `unit_price`, `total_price` (numeric)
- `created_at`

**`intervention_photos`** - Documentation visuelle
- `id` (uuid, PK)
- `tenant_id` (uuid, FK → tenants)
- `intervention_id` (uuid, FK → interventions)
- `photo_url` (text)
- `description` (text)
- `created_at`

**`repair_history`** - Historique des réparations
- `id` (uuid, PK)
- `tenant_id` (uuid, FK → tenants)
- `vehicle_id` (uuid, FK → vehicles)
- `client_id` (uuid, FK → clients)
- `description` (text)
- `mileage_at_repair` (integer)
- `cost` (numeric)
- `performed_by` (uuid, FK → profiles)
- `repair_date` (date)
- `notes` (text)

---

#### 📅 Planning & Rendez-vous

**`services`** - Catalogue de services
- `id` (uuid, PK)
- `tenant_id` (uuid, FK → tenants)
- `name`, `description` (text)
- `estimated_duration_minutes` (integer)
- `price` (numeric)
- `category` (text) - entretien, réparation, diagnostic
- `is_active` (boolean)
- `created_at`, `updated_at`

**`appointments`** - Rendez-vous atelier
- `id` (uuid, PK)
- `tenant_id` (uuid, FK → tenants)
- `client_id` (uuid, FK → clients, nullable)
- `vehicle_id` (uuid, FK → vehicles, nullable)
- `mechanic_id` (uuid, FK → profiles, nullable)
- `service_id` (uuid, FK → services, nullable)
- `appointment_date` (date)
- `start_time`, `end_time` (time)
- `status` (text) - scheduled, confirmed, completed, cancelled
- `notes` (text)
- `customer_name`, `customer_phone`, `customer_email` (text) - Pour réservations publiques
- `vehicle_plate`, `vehicle_make`, `vehicle_model` (text) - Pour réservations publiques
- `created_at`, `updated_at`

---

#### 💰 Facturation

**`invoices`** - Factures et devis
- `id` (uuid, PK)
- `tenant_id` (uuid, FK → tenants)
- `intervention_id` (uuid, FK → interventions, nullable)
- `client_id` (uuid, FK → clients, nullable)
- `invoice_number`, `quote_number` (text, unique par tenant)
- `type` (text) - invoice, quote
- `status` (text) - draft, sent, paid, overdue
- `description`, `notes` (text)
- `subtotal_ex_tax`, `tax_rate`, `tax_amount`, `total_inc_tax` (numeric)
- `currency` (text, default: EUR)
- `issued_date`, `due_date`, `paid_date` (date)
- `created_at`, `updated_at`

**`invoice_items`** - Lignes de facturation
- `id` (uuid, PK)
- `invoice_id` (uuid, FK → invoices)
- `description` (text)
- `quantity`, `unit_price`, `subtotal` (numeric)
- `created_at`

