### Nouvelles Tables

#### 📦 **`parts`** - Catalogue de pièces
- `id` (uuid, PK)
- `tenant_id` (uuid, FK → tenants)
- `name` (text)
- `reference` (text, SKU)
- `manufacturer` (text)
- `buy_price`, `sell_price` (numeric)
- `stock_quantity` (integer)
- `min_stock_threshold` (integer)
- `created_at`, `updated_at`
