#### 📊 **`stock_movements`** - Mouvements de stock
- `id` (uuid, PK)
- `tenant_id` (uuid, FK → tenants)
- `part_id` (uuid, FK → parts)
- `intervention_id` (uuid, FK → interventions, nullable)
- `movement_type` (text) - in, out, adjustment
- `quantity` (integer) - Positif/négatif
- `unit_price` (numeric)
- `notes` (text)
- `created_at`

### Modifications de Tables Existantes

#### 🔧 **`interventions`** - Ajouts
```sql
ALTER TABLE interventions
  ADD COLUMN appointment_id uuid REFERENCES appointments(id) ON DELETE SET NULL,
  ADD COLUMN quote_id uuid REFERENCES invoices(id) ON DELETE SET NULL;
```

#### 👥 **`clients`** - Enrichissement
```sql
ALTER TABLE clients
  ADD COLUMN client_type text DEFAULT 'individual' CHECK (client_type IN ('individual', 'professional')),
  ADD COLUMN company_name text,
  ADD COLUMN siret text,
  ADD COLUMN vat_number text,
  ADD COLUMN city text,
  ADD COLUMN zip_code text;
```

#### 🔩 **`intervention_parts`** - Liaison catalogue
```sql
ALTER TABLE intervention_parts
  ADD COLUMN part_id uuid REFERENCES parts(id) ON DELETE SET NULL;
```

### Tables à Supprimer

#### ❌ **`repair_history`** - Redondante
> Utiliser `interventions` avec `status = 'completed'` pour l'historique.

